WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.604
- All right, we've got a super sweet story

00:00:02.604 --> 00:00:03.690
to close out this hour.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:04.847
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:04.847 --> 00:00:07.664
(rock music)

00:00:07.664 --> 00:00:10.320
This past Christmas, a
grandma in New York decided

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.060
to create her very own cookbook

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:13.800
made of her signature dishes.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.440
She wanted to ensure her
family had their favorite meals

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.510
for a long time to
come, which is so sweet.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:19.770
Once she put it all together,

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:21.840
she realized she needed cover art,

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.240
so she turned to her granddaughter, Kate.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:25.950
And here's what Kate came up with.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.170
It is so rad.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.300
Kate's painting has TikTok buzzing

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.590
with over half a million views

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.820
and we have her on the line right now

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:35.370
watching on News Channel 13 in Albany.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.661
Hi Kate.

00:00:37.661 --> 00:00:39.330
- Hey, Kelly.

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.070
- You are so talented.

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:42.120
And so cool.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.260
It's such cool cover art.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:45.720
So this project was
something your grandma wanted

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.370
for a long time, right?

00:00:47.370 --> 00:00:50.113
- Yeah, I mean, honestly, as
far back as I can remember

00:00:50.113 --> 00:00:52.890
my family's always going
over to my grandma's house

00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:55.260
for Sunday dinner and I come from like

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:56.640
I'm at one of six kids,

00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.730
so my grandma knows how to
like pull out all the stops

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.170
and cook for all of us.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.580
And the cookbook idea,

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.140
I mean we've all encouraged her to do it

00:01:04.140 --> 00:01:06.690
through the years, but this
past year, my sister, Emma,

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:08.370
really got the ball going.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:11.244
A couple of family members
helped with assembly,

00:01:11.244 --> 00:01:13.650
and at the end she asked
me to do the cover.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:15.270
But it was a secret,

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:16.800
because we wanted to
surprise everyone else

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.210
like with the finished product.

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:20.010
And I ended up filming it on TikTok,

00:01:20.010 --> 00:01:22.290
and then the response
to that was so sweet,

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:24.240
just like people saying, "Oh,

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:26.940
I wish I could have done
this with my grandma."

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:28.170
People saying like, "Oh,
you've inspired me."

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:29.970
Other people like wanting
a copy of the book.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:32.340
So, that stuff has just been so cool.

00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:33.780
- Oh my god, it is so cool.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.150
What a cool family thing to do together.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.020
- Yeah.

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:38.760
- To make sure that you honor your grandma

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:40.650
by getting every detail just right.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:41.610
Tell us about the process.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.530
Like there was a photo
shoot and everything, right?

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:44.850
- Oh, yeah.

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:48.720
So step one, I bossed my poor
grandma around in her kitchen

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:50.160
and took a bunch of pictures

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:52.950
of different things around
her kitchen to inspire me.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:54.750
And I came up with a
sketch, went from there.

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:57.030
And my favorite part is
all the details we included

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:58.500
from her actual house.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.930
So it's like her geese
wallpaper in the back,

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.020
her actual cookie jar, her
geese salt and pepper shakers,

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.188
her actual dog, all that kind of stuff.

00:02:05.188 --> 00:02:07.140
And when my family got to see it,

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:09.330
it was a big surprise
for a bunch of people.

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:10.920
And everyone loved all those details.

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:12.540
So it's just so cool
that it's finished now.

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.580
We can have it forever, and I don't know,

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:16.470
I'm really proud to
have been a part of it.

00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:17.370
- It's so cool.

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.167
It's a way to have your grandma with you

00:02:19.167 --> 00:02:20.550
for the rest of your life.

00:02:20.550 --> 00:02:21.780
That's an amazing thing.

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:22.613
- Yes.

00:02:22.613 --> 00:02:23.760
- You are very cool by the way.

00:02:23.760 --> 00:02:26.430
Your whole look is so
cute and rock and roll.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.390
I love it.

00:02:27.390 --> 00:02:28.223
- Kelly.

00:02:28.223 --> 00:02:29.700
- Oh my god, you're
wearing a onesie as well.

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:31.320
You're so cute.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:32.730
Thank you so much, Kate.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:35.328
I'm liking your post and you right now.

00:02:35.328 --> 00:02:36.161
(audience cheering)

00:02:36.161 --> 00:02:36.994
And that's not all, girl.

00:02:36.994 --> 00:02:38.550
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.260
makers of FriXion, the go-to erasable pen

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.310
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:41.310 --> 00:02:43.920
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:44.753
just like you, ma'am.

00:02:44.753 --> 00:02:46.740
So they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:47.573
How's that sound?

00:02:47.573 --> 00:02:50.256
(audience cheering)

00:02:50.256 --> 00:02:53.200
- [Kate] Kelly, no, they're not.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.960
- Thank you so much, Kate,

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.580
for sharing your family with us

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:58.230
and thank you to all our guests this hour:

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:01.260
Seal, Ava Max, Becky
Lynch, and Courtney Rich.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:02.093
Y'all have a great day.

00:03:02.093 --> 00:03:03.700
And if it's not, try and change it.

